    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45aec59b4f9ab0e4e40b991",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许那边有花坛。\n……那么，这次去那边看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4a810b5a66fbec87f6be66a3e21441696d0b8fc734ae553b43d823c47533ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
