    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9daafbe4ad124ef5a482d8c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……之后，我仍和空中救世主不断向前走。\n走过开满缤纷花朵的花坛，\n走上一直延伸到花坛另一侧的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e02716ed3ec6c8304673cbf528ca52471a799aa8001cce1055bc6962019a64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:700d7adbe0ab574048e81b6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "走过回荡着孩子们笑声的游乐设施旁。\n走过水鸟嬉戏的池塘边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8769601120fca84d7b94f997a36cae0eedc5be9865df131aff5fe85a7ba0f95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeecc92889b9219fb218dd83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和空中救世主，一直向前走。\n然后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3de5dca52c1793e7dc111015a298565d42e45b47fcc1e444b8d7cce18f2f2e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bc107e1c58f037147b7cb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀！对不起，谢谢你提醒我",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc8daf6eceb5f8f5862041627a81956d8a1d4e4a0733a6e524a6ebdf40351b91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
