      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24d68be8783817040d8ae813",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在山道上小憩时，我一不留神\n站到了赛马娘专用道路上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a00738598eb6c1e6de904595d27b81410864023b419a78ed9608e10ac45b6f4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f890d38195fce55b8dd8120",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过空中救世主提醒，\n我连忙离开那里。就在这时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7a5797519710c35203e0072b40a7b0ac03da3eebdc04acb08a9629181aabd3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111111.json",
